the language is open-ended because the technology is still being developed and we need to figure out what are appropriate uses and what are inappropriate uses. You know, video capture seems to be most, problematic to try and infer employee characteristics from their feet, you know, how they look or how they, how they, what the emotions on their face and so on. That, that seems very problematic and it is. It's not like, it's not like the algorithm did detect highly relevant job features and, and we should be using it. There doesn't seem to be evidence for that. So the evidence, lack of evidence,

